sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Op as Operator
  participant Bao as OpenBao (VIP)
  participant Agent as OpenBao Agent on VM 310
  participant App as PVE exporter
  Op->>Bao: Create a response-wrapped SecretID for the role
  Op->>Agent: Install RoleID and wrapped SecretID (mode 0600)
  Agent->>Bao: Unwrap, then AppRole login (RoleID + SecretID, source CIDR bound)
  Bao-->>Agent: Short-TTL token, one policy
  Agent->>Bao: Read kv/observability/pve-exporter
  Bao-->>Agent: Secret
  Agent->>App: Render file under /run (mode 0600)
  App->>App: Read the *_FILE path, no token in Compose or inventory
  Agent->>Bao: Renew or re-login before TTL expiry
